{
  "name": "TestAuditAccumulatesHandledAndUnhandledErrors",
  "comment": "Audit is the run-wide accumulator of every observed error (per debug.md: \"Run-wide accumulator of every error. Survives Pop.\"). It records the error at each Call frame it propagates through, not once per unique error — so 4 inner throws (each handled) + 1 fourth throw + 2 propagation frames for the fourth (goal.call ThrowItem and the foreach goal.call) = 7. The outer handler catches the fourth, so %finalCaught% becomes true.",
